@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to CodePursuit</h1>
    <h2>The rules of CodePursuit are simple:</h2>
    
        <p>You choose the name for up to 6 players. </p>
        <p>Then one of you are choosen randomly as the 
            first player to role the dice. </p>
        <p>When you roll a die, you get one of the categories 
            decided by your roll:
            1. Java
            2. JavaScript
            3. HTML/CSS
            4. Python
            5. Game History
            6. C#
        </p>
        <p>Then you will be asked a question from the 
            category you rolled. 
            If you answer correctly, 
            you get a wedge. If you answer incorrectly, 
            you do not get a wedge.</p>
        <p>When a player gets all 6 wedges, 
            then on his/her/their turn, 
            the other players choose a category 
            for them to answer.</p>
        <p>If the player answers correctly,
            then they win the game.</p>
        <p>If answered incorrectly, then the game continues  
            until one of the other players gets all 6 wedges 
            and answers correctly to win the game, 
            or a player with all 6 wedges answers correctly.
        </p>

        <img src="~/images/home/categories.png"
         alt="Coding categories"
         class="home-category-image" />
        
</div>
